### Criar segundo autor
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Autor Dois", "nationality": "Brasileira", "birthDate": "1950-01-01" }

### Criar livro
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Dom Casmurro", "isbn": "9788535910663", "year": 1899, "totalCopies": 3, "categoryId": 1, "authorIds": [1, 2] }

### Livro com categoria inexistente
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Teste", "isbn": "111", "totalCopies": 1, "categoryId": 999, "authorIds": [1] }

### Listar todos
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/books

### Filtrar por título
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/books?title=dom

### Filtrar por categoria
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/books?categoryId=1

### Filtrar por autor
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/books?authorId=1

### Só disponíveis
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/books?available=true

### Editar (trocar autores e total)
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "totalCopies": 5, "authorIds": [1] }

### Excluir categoria com livro (deve dar 409)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/v1/categories/1

### Excluir autor com livro (deve dar 409)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/v1/authors/1